@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@token = ISI_TOKEN_SECARA_LOKAL_JANGAN_COMMIT
@siswa = 1
@challenge = ISI_CHALLENGE_UUID_DARI_RESPONS

### Login email (ganti hanya di salinan lokal)
POST {{base}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.test","password":"GANTI_DI_LOKAL"}

### Pendaftaran siswa setelah master NISN+email tersedia
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"full_name":"Nama Akun","email":"siswa@example.test","nisn":"0000000001","password":"GANTI_DI_LOKAL","password_confirmation":"GANTI_DI_LOKAL"}

### OTP pendaftaran
POST {{base}}/register/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"challenge_id":"{{challenge}}","otp":"ISI_OTP_LOKAL"}

### Pemulihan tahap 1
POST {{base}}/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"email":"siswa@example.test"}

### Pemulihan tahap 2, respons berisi challenge grant baru
POST {{base}}/forgot-password/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"challenge_id":"{{challenge}}","otp":"ISI_OTP_LOKAL"}

### Google: gunakan client_id dan nonce hasil ini pada FE
POST {{base}}/auth/google/challenge
Accept: application/json

### Profil sendiri
GET {{base}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Simpan rapor admin
PUT {{base}}/siswa/{{siswa}}/nilai-rapor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"semester":1,"nilai":[{"mata_pelajaran_id":1,"nilai_akhir":85}]}

### Program eligibilitas, nilai sekadar contoh bukan kebijakan sekolah
POST {{base}}/program-eligibilitas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"nama":"Program Contoh","kriteria":[{"nama_kriteria":"TKA","tipe_kriteria":"nilai_tka","operator":">=","nilai_kriteria":"80"}]}

### Eligibilitas diri siswa
GET {{base}}/eligibilitas/saya
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Generate draft persiapan beasiswa kuliah oleh admin
POST {{base}}/siswa/{{siswa}}/rekomendasi-beasiswa/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"target_jenjang":"Kuliah"}

### Daftar jejak alumni yang berizin, untuk siswa
GET {{base}}/jejak-alumni
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
